        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Moonless Sky.</em> A blade of black reiatsu pours from your arm.</p><p><strong>60-foot cone</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>spirit</strong> damage.</p><p>This <strong>ignores all resistances and immunities to spirit damage</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>Canon's Saigo no Getsuga Tensh&#333; is the <strong>state</strong> &mdash; here, Severance &mdash; and Mugetsu is the one attack inside it. Every other Spirit gets the same two-part shape.</em></p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
